{"product_id":"uncle-jack-and-the-emperor-penguins-cd","title":"Uncle Jack and the Emperor Penguins + CD","description":"\u003cp\u003eHere are the Emperor Penguins as happy as can be. They're off to lay their eggs in a place far from the sea. They stay here all the winter as cold as cold can be. Until their babies hatch in a place far from the sea.' In this Reader you will find: Games and language activities An audio recording of the story and the song A picture dictionary Tags Adventure Social Issues Animal Story In this hilarious story you will learn something about the habits of the Emperor Penguins and follow Uncle Jack and the others in their race against time to help the penguins to the place where they lay their eggs.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 150 x 212\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jane Cadwallader\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9788853604262\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 32\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45472789201049,"sku":"7RC9788853604262","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/684ff9af07c7e_Uncle_Jack_and_the_Emperor_Penguins___CD_Jane_Cadwallader.jpg?v=1752084371","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/uncle-jack-and-the-emperor-penguins-cd","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}